[] 4) Lets keep nethack "equal opportunity" by relating the spell casting
[]    ability only to intelligence and not give Wizards any more head start
[]    than their natural intelligence gives them.   After all, if they eat
[]    enough spinach so that they can fight like a Barbarian, the barbarian
[]    should be able to quaff enough blessed potions of enlightenment to
